control: A mutation patch is refused when a hunk's context matches at more than one place in its file
removes: every hunk of a file is matched against the file as it stands, not as the hunks before it leave it
packages: ./testsupport/cmd/mutproof/...
tests: TestHunkMatchReadsTheFileAsEarlierHunksLeaveIt TestHunkMatchNeverMatchesOverAnEarlierHunk
scheduled-count: no

